      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I got a horseshoe 'round my neck",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Lot of angels that stay close",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And a pretty boy up on my chest",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And he loves me like a psycho",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "So who am I to cry tonight?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Such a lucky girl, I know",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "But where should all my sadness go?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Where should my sadness go?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I got it, I promise",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Just broke down on the plane (Ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I wrote down my feelings",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But they won't go away",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And I drank on Monday",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Then straight through Saturday",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "What's good? Mm-mm",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "(What's good? What's good?)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Got twenty thousand people just smiling",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And it only takes one to get me spiraling",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Hit a joint, but it didn't get high for me",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'm not a pop star when I'm all alone",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
